OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage buildings not at risk
OL,4,Aafter regeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic town centre is no longer
OL,7,Fconsidered at risk after its
OL,8,Fregeneration, Historic England says.
OL,10,FLoftus Conservation Area has been
OL,11,Fremoved from the Heritage at Risk
OL,12,Fregister after a derelict church was
OL,13,Ftransformed into an artists' space, a
OL,14,Fnew training hub was created, and
OL,15,Fshopfronts were restored in the town.
OL,17,FRector of Loftus, Canon Adam Gaunt,
OL,18,Fsaid: "It's taken a lot of years and a
OL,19,Flot of hard work, but it is a wonderful
OL,20,Ffeeling we've been able to move away
OL,21,Ffrom being at risk."
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
