OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage buildings not at risk
OL,4,Aafter regeneration
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolmslinn lead mine in Allendale and
OL,7,FWest End Dovecote in Houghton le Side
OL,8,Fwere also removed from the list, but
OL,9,Fthe Londonderry Institute in Seaham and
OL,10,FChrist Church in Felling have been
OL,11,Fadded.
